WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:09.520
What links my heart...

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.770
Rouge!

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:16.860
...to your heart is...

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.400
Rouge!

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.630
She can't hear me?

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:14.530
Rouge!

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:17.620
Rouge!

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:26.840
Far more than some vague friendship...

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.140
Rouge!

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.460
CLUTCH SHOT

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.090
Wait for me, Rouge!

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:45.130
Tonight is finally the night.

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:47.270
I hear the crowd outside is incredible.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.440
Now I'm getting nervous.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:51.890
Let's make it a concert to remember.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.780
They're not fooling around.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.700
Troops all over the place.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:04.470
Yes. They've strengthened security for the concert.

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:20.310
Rouge is in there?

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:20.990
Yes.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:23.770
We've got no other choice.

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:24.720
We'll have to force our way in.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:26.010
We can't.

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:27.270
If you cause an uproar here...

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:31.600
Such trifles are easily handled by royal power.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:35.250
Go on, Princess, impress upon them the might of the royal family.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.400
I will, Jiiya.

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:38.860
Clear the path!

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:42.850
Who do you think this personage is?

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:48.790
Well you may tremble, for she is His Majesty Regalia the Thirteenth's second daughter,

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.120
Her Royal Highness Flora Skybloom!

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:53.000
Bow your heads!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.600
Without a pass, I'm afraid we can't let even the royal family in.

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:00.220
Wh-What?

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:03.380
I-In that case...

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:05.640
What do you think of this?!

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:08.710
Th-That... Could it be...?

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:10.980
The Number Seven Platinum member card!

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:13.190
One moment!

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.350
Yes... Yes!

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:17.180
You're approved.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:18.360
Please, pass.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:24.060
A fan club membership treated with more awe than proof of royalty...

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.580
It's the end of the world.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.870
Quickly, Mr. Dan, let's go in.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:34.250
Oh dear... I feel for you, princess.

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:36.410
I don't mind.

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:40.600
I'm glad I was able to help him along.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:43.690
Here we go, Jiiya!

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:45.850
You've become strong...

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.140
Are you sure?

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:52.300
Letting fugitives into the stadium...

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.600
Let me do as I please.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:54.970
But, sir...

00:02:54.970 --> 00:03:00.640
By order of King Regalia, I am entrusted with complete authority over the concert.

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:03.060
I take full responsibility.

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:03.890
Sir.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.740
It's all proceeding as planned.

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:10.660
Rouge, where are you?

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.170
Where are you?

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:17.000
Rouge!

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.010
Rouge!

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:36.050
I-It's been a while, huh?

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:37.130
Doing well?

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:41.320
Well, yeah, I guess not "well." You were recovering and stuff.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.860
But I'm glad it seems like you're doing better than I thought.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.700
Finally I'm here, Rouge.

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:56.480
Who are you?

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.130
Who are you?

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:06.250
Oh, are you a fan? I'm sorry!

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:09.510
We're rehearsing right now so I can't give autographs...

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.900
Idiot! Don't joke around like that.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:15.920
Hey! Keep your distance.

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.540
Somebody come here, please!

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:20.350
What is it, Rouge?

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:21.440
Dan!

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:24.560
Do something about this guy, would you?

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:27.610
He barged right in and started babbling nonsense!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.860
Are you serious?

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:35.180
Citron, Violette, call someone on staff, quickly!

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.750
W-Wait, Rouge!

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.850
It's all right. Just calm down.

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:40.120
But...

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.930
Hey, what's going on?

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:43.960
She's acting weird!

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:47.290
Rouge is a little tired.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.220
Leave her alone, please.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:50.380
You expect me to believe that? She—

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:51.950
Dan! Please.

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:53.960
What are you talking about?

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.720
You two know this guy?

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:57.010
No.

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:00.190
You're a fan, aren't you? You're after an autograph?

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.940
Thanks for all your support!

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:13.250
It's weird... It's like there's a fog in my head and I can't think straight.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:17.190
It's okay. You don't have to think about anything but the concert tonight.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:21.040
Calling all of Eclipse! We're ready to set up for the next song!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.130
Coming!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.090
Hey, wait a second, Rouge!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.800
Rouge!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:31.560
There's no time to talk to you now. Forgive me.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:34.320
Citron!

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.500
Coming!

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.290
Mr. Dan.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:48.080
Don't worry, it's coming along well.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.190
This should be able to handle anything that happens.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:00.270
No problems on my end either.

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:03.640
All the basquashers should have arrived by now.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:09.200
I'm so glad!

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:11.720
Everyone made it over the border safely!

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:15.000
Oh? Weren't you the one who arranged it, Alan?

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.580
They waved us right through.

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:19.750
Thanks, Princess Flora.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.270
Everybody's figured it out.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:25.450
I didn't do anything, though...

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:28.960
Why worry about it?

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.940
We're through, that's the important thing.

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:35.170
Though it went so smoothly that it's kinda creepy.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.760
Dan, did you see Rouge?

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:42.950
Did something happen?

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:43.660
Shut up!

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.390
Something's rubbed him the wrong way!

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:48.540
Maybe Rouge dumped him!

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:52.880
She looked right at me and asked who I was.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.890
And what the hell is this supposed to mean? {sz: sign appears to read "tespas cap" :/  ...trespass something?}

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:02.110
"Crash the party... I dare you"?

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:05.390
Citron wrote it right before they left, but I don't get it!

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:12.780
No worries. The Bigfoots are primed and ready to go.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:19.030
That can't mean... she wants us to crash the concert?

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:20.390
For real?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.290
Sounds like fun!

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.110
That's a message from Citron.

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:27.290
If you play them, it should all become clear.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.480
And you'll get answers about Rouge.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.180
What'll we do, Dan?

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:38.430
Like you have to ask!

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:43.470
The rehearsal went smoothly.

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:46.310
Now we simply prepare for the real show tonight.

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:55.150
I swear I will show you a success.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:58.310
I heard an unsettling rumor.

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.600
What was that?

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:04.540
That a wanted man was spotted lurking around the stadium.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.680
That issue is no cause for alarm.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:12.490
The second coming of the legend may well require one or two over-the-top performances.

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.190
Nevertheless...

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:15.790
Rest assured.

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:21.700
Our sole aim is to save Earthdash and maintain the safety of this marvelous country.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.830
Thank you for coming, everyone!

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:54.040
This is our final stage...

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:56.050
Time to burn it up!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.060
kagami no mukou  iru no wa dare

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.060
Who is it on the far side of the mirror?

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:13.610
rasen no kibou  hagareochiteyuku

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:13.610
The spiraling hope peels away turn after turn

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:17.400
pazuru no piisu  mitsukaranakute

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:17.400
We can't find the pieces to the puzzle

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:20.320
unmei ga itai  mune wo gyutto tsukamu

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:20.320
Our fate hurts us, clawing at our chests

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:22.790
dakara zettai...

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:22.790
So there is no doubt!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:29.660
taemanaku tsuzuiteku michi ga koko ni aru naraba

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:29.660
If there's a path here, endless and unbroken,

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:39.390
sukoshizutsu  mieteku mirai no imi wa kitto shinka suru

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:39.390
the meaning of the slowly-unveiled future will evolve...

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.380
Sounds like it's started.

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:38.090
It's time.

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:42.480
genjitsu da yo

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:42.480
It's reality;

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:44.280
subete ga kitto  kanashikutemo

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:44.280
though all things grieve...

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:43.700
Who are you?

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:45.930
nagareru keshiki  hakanakutemo

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:45.930
Though the flowing scenery is as flimsy as a dream...

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:48.740
tsutaeru nanika wo  sagashitsuzukete

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:48.740
Still seeking something to pass down,

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:51.250
bokura wa ikiteku...

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:51.250
we'll live on...

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:01.880
This is the front gate. No problems.

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.900
West gate and east gate, no problems.

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:08.370
Backstage by the emergency exit. No one suspicious.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:15.840
What astonishing exuberance, Father.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:16.790
Yes.

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:20.760
It unsettles me, for some reason.

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.290
Understand?

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:24.820
Wait there for my instructions.

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:26.640
The real show hasn't started yet.

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:31.770
kasaneta yubi ga nazoru you ni

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:31.770
Like the trail left by our fingers entwined

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:35.350
futae no kokoro motomete iru

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:35.350
We seek our siamese heart

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.650
furishikiru ame yagate niji e

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.650
In time the downpour clears to a rainbow

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:42.740
kimi to no yakusoku

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:42.740
That's my promise with you.

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:48.410
Are you ready, everyone?

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:51.660
We'll show you our legend!

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:57.630
This is the moment the curtain rises on the legend! Here we go!

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.380
Five!

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.630
Four!

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:02.070
Three!

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:05.930
Come on, Dan! Set Rouge free too!

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:03.780
Two!

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:05.930
One!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.050
Zero!

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:14.390
Here we go!

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.230
Rouge!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:18.350
What's that?

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:19.330
Catch it!

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:26.660
Pin him down!

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.120
Call the Royal Guards!

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.200
So you came, Legend.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.420
Not bad!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.770
You came after all, Dan!

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:42.920
What on <i>earth</i>?

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:46.930
Rouge! Basquash time!

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:56.940
Hear that, everyone? At our final concert Eclipse has been challenged to a match!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.940
What'll we do?

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:02.680
Well of course, there's no way we're chickening out!

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:06.070
Rouge, let's go!

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:08.530
Trust us!

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.300
Here I come, Rouge!

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:35.590
I'm <i>not</i> gonna lose.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:39.840
What happened to the concert?

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:41.500
Go for it, Eclipse!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:42.680
Rouge!

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:45.190
You Bigfoots, stop right there!

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:46.980
What's the meaning of this?

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:49.110
Get things back under control!

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:51.880
Your wish is my command, sire.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:57.080
Our national heritage is crumbling...

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:08.410
Are you all okay?

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:10.340
They called for emergency reinforcements!

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:12.040
Head for the stadium, on the double!

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:14.720
You there, get your ass in gear!

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:21.690
Showdown time, Rouge!

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:22.560
Citron!

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:26.190
What? Don't wanna take me on?

00:13:26.190 --> 00:13:27.610
That's not like you!

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:29.800
Who on earth are you?

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:32.630
What are you pretending to know about me?

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.380
It's boring, playing like that!

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:37.580
When I know what you really want is to catch fire!

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.830
I'll push you into basquatting!

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:45.320
What's the deal with that guy?

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:48.800
Violette!

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:54.690
You are under arrest on charges of property damage and violation of national security!

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:57.310
You think you can capture the Hurricane?

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.840
Surround her!

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:01.340
Oh, so I'm as popular as I thought?

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.350
Keep telling yourself that.

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:04.520
Alan, take it!

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:07.020
You guys get a little better and I'll play with you.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:09.290
This is an important match!

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:10.570
Don't get in the way!

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:13.580
Yes, it's an important match.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.940
Both for Eclipse and for Mr. Dan.

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:20.290
I want to do every little bit I can to help him!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.000
Alan!

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:27.020
Mr. Dan...

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:28.460
Princess!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.690
Navi!

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:38.960
She's injured.

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:40.340
I'll take custody of her.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:43.400
Uh, understood. Thanks.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.390
Dan, Sela.

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:46.000
You can hear me, can't you?

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.470
Alan's injured.

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:49.900
Navi will be substituted in.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:53.530
Flora.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.290
Why is Flora there?

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.120
Did you know?

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:01.240
Did you not, Father?

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:06.200
Were you not even interested in where your own daughter was?

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:12.960
In what she was doing, what she was thinking, what she was feeling?

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:18.130
Flora is being true to herself and fighting to change the future.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:19.850
Navi!

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:21.140
Sela!

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:25.410
Those two are breathing in sync!

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.340
Their hearts resonate with each other.

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:31.960
It's the power of love. Maybe.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:42.200
Good stuff! Keep going!

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.410
This basquash thing is cool!

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:46.820
This area is dangerous! Go home, everyone!

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:48.550
It's just getting good!

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:49.880
Don't get in the way!

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.680
Hear that, Father?

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:56.590
The voices of the people raised in excitement?

00:15:56.590 --> 00:16:01.740
Yes. I had forgotten for so long...

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:04.670
Forgotten the sound of my peoples' voice.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.680
Play me, Rouge!

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:08.850
You never go away!

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:11.650
Right now you're playing like a robot!

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.420
Did you forget that too?

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:14.610
What are you talking about?

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:16.820
Then I'll make you remember!

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:22.990
How real basquash is played!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.160
What's this feeling?

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:33.290
There's a fervor in my chest...

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.380
That's what I'm talking about!

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:43.480
Nice!

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:44.600
Go Rouge!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.640
Keep up, Idol Red!

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:48.940
What? What do you mean by "Red"?

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:51.400
Shut up. You'll figure it out any time now.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.840
Says lord high-and-mighty!

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:53.900
Who does he think he is?

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:03.080
Stop them! Stop them!

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:06.710
There's no stopping us now!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:17.610
Aren't those two playing a little too hard?

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:19.470
I hope they don't get hurt...

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:21.890
They're in their own little world.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:24.270
I wonder if she remembered.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.010
No way to know yet.

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:27.430
But...

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:30.730
Right now, that girl's basquatting.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:39.360
Take a look at that light...

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:50.380
This pattern— it matches those ruins!

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:57.000
Mr. Dan is the legend after all.

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:02.720
Not too shabby.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:06.680
I don't like it much, but when I'm playing against you, my body moves by itself.

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:08.200
Yeah, that's fine.

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:10.060
It's not basquash if you don't catch fire!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.030
Bas...quash?

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:14.690
Come on!

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.880
This feeling... it's familiar.

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:25.230
My chest is burning, my pulse is pounding.

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:28.160
That's right.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:33.760
In my dream, there was someone I kept calling and calling for...

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.630
Who on earth are you?

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:37.890
I'm me.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.740
The basquasher Dan JD!

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:51.270
Basquasher...

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:55.400
My... Dan!

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:56.870
How about it?

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:59.320
Basquash is pretty good, huh, Idol Red?

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:01.930
Not "Red," "Rouge."

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:03.450
It's about time you memorized it.

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:06.550
Rouge, long time no see.

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.090
I'm back.

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:13.830
Oh, Rouge!

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:15.670
Her memories came back.

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:41.730
Go!

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:42.480
Go!

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:43.320
Go!

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:45.250
Go.

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:48.780
This is ours...

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:50.240
Ours...

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:53.750
Our Basquash!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:55.960
Now!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.670
The stones will awaken!

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:32.910
Stop right there.

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:37.210
Do it.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.490
No!

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:49.880
Dan!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.310
If he's the legend, he can make it through.

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:57.780
Through any crisis?

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:59.930
The beloved of the gods...

00:20:59.930 --> 00:21:01.240
...that's what a legend is.

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:04.620
Next time: 'Cause Slash Said So

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:07.430
NEXT TIME

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:07.430
'CAUSE

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:07.430
SLASH

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:07.430
SAID

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:07.430
SO

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:06.610
Random voices, right?
